      "spam": false,
      "value": "Ick... that restrictive?  That would deter alot of people from joining alot of events in the first place, especially when folks like myself have very specific characters they use as a self identity.  Granted, yes I could attempt to make a version that lacks those details just to get to 1 material.  \n\nHowever I do suggest on top of this would be something that can turn off Dynamic bones from working for avatars that have them, as I know that is a big contributer to performance.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
