  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Have the ability to place avatar limits when creating new instances of a world. For example, a world being used to host an event would probably want to restrict entry down to avatars with 1 material, 1 mesh, and possibly under a certain poly count. This could help greatly with keeping events running as smoothly as possible with the growing community.",
